---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact The Field & Farm: Questions, Ideas & Feedback" description="How to get in touch with The Field & Farm.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Have a correction, a suggestion for a guide, or a question about a topic we should cover? We read everything.
  </p>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Get in touch</h3>
    <p>
      For corrections, topic suggestions, and general inquiries, email us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@thefieldandfarm.com">hello@thefieldandfarm.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      For partnership or affiliate inquiries, use the same address and mention
      "partnership" in the subject line.
    </p>
    <p>
      We aim to reply within 3 business days. We do not provide individual legal,
      tax, or accounting advice: for that, please consult a qualified professional.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
